From b4f0c2b4934563c8ad0d78f0d256768454406c29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 08:24:26 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 16/26] uml: run Darwin guests on fixed vCPU carriers

Keep carrier lifetime, host-stop wakeup, cross-CPU service, and the hot current-vCPU lookup together as one fixed-carrier scheduler topic.
---
